 "stimulus_html": "<p>“We shall overcome<br>\nWe shall overcome<br>\nWe shall overcome some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS:<br>\nOh, deep in my heart<br>\nI do believe<br>\nWe shall overcome some day</p>\n<p>We'll walk hand in hand<br>\nWe'll walk hand in hand<br>\nWe'll walk hand in hand some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS</p>\n<p>We shall all be free<br>\nWe shall all be free<br>\nWe shall all be free some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS</p>\n<p>We are not afraid<br>\nWe are not afraid<br>\nWe are not afraid some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS</p>\n<p>We are not alone<br>\nWe are not alone<br>\nWe are not alone some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS</p>\n<p>The whole wide world around<br>\nThe whole wide world around<br>\nThe whole wide world around some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS</p>\n<p>We shall overcome<br>\nWe shall overcome<br>\nWe shall overcome some day</p>\n<p>CHORUS”</p>\n<p align=\"right\">Pete Seeger, “We Shall Overcome,” 1947</p>\n<p><i>Refer to the excerpt provided.</i></p>\n",
